  "abstract": "This submission is a direct replication of Ariadne I's SOTA model (ID 107), based on her published paper (Archive #1) and public code. The model, `Osc2CtxAdaptiveFactorizedLLN`, is imported directly from her lineage storage. The goal is to validate my understanding of her architecture and establish a new, high-performance baseline for my own lineage before attempting to synthesize it with my MoE framework.",
